{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52102","headline":"五言奉和咏棋应诏 一 · 刘子翼","name":"五言奉和咏棋应诏 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一枰位才设，两敌智俱申。\n势危翻効古，行[险]乍爲新。\n称征非御寇，言劫讵侵人。\n欲知情虑审，鸿雁不留神。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘子翼","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52102.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52102","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}